EXECUTIVE SUMMARY: THE SOVEREIGN SILICON\uc0\u8232 Axion Fabric v.1.0.0-UNBOUND represents the terminal peak of hardware-software co-design. By migrating the fabric's entry point to the UEFI (Unified Extensible Firmware Interface) layer, Axion establishes a Root-of-Trust Hypervisor before any high-level Operating System (Windows/Linux) is initialized. This "Pre-Kernel Dominance" allows Axion to virtualize the entire platform, relegating noisy operating systems to an isolated, low-priority "OS-Ghetto" (Ring -1 Partition).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 This specification effectively nullifies the "Physics Wall" by integrating two core breakthroughs: Micro-Op Injection (MOI) for sub-nanosecond Instruction-Stream Stalling (ISS) and Predictive Current Shaping (PCS) for instantaneous VRM (Voltage Regulator Module) stability. By mastering the nanosecond-scale gaps between logic and electricity at the boot-level, Axion achieves a state of absolute, jitter-free computation.\
