\cf0 A. The Stealth Segment\
Axion hides a specific RAM segment from the OS E820 memory map. This "Ghost Memory" is used for Fractal Snapshots. Data is injected directly into the L3-Cloister via Data Direct I/O (DDIO), bypassing the DRAM latency wall entirely.\
Equation 2: Fractal Delta (D_f)\
